{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 23,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Sectarianism Is Carnal"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I, brethren, could not speak to you as to spiritual "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "people"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but as to carnal, as to babes in Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I fed you with milk and not with solid food; for until now you were not able "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to receive it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and even now you are still not able; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for you are still carnal. For where "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " envy, strife, and divisions among you, are you not carnal and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. walking according to man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "behaving like "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mere"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " men? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For when one says, “I am of Paul,” and another, “I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Apollos,” are you not carnal?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Watering, Working, Warning"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who then is Paul, and who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Apollos, but ministers through whom you believed, as the Lord gave to each one? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I planted, Apollos watered, but God gave the increase. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So then neither he who plants is anything, nor he who waters, but God who gives the increase. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now he who plants and he who waters are one, and each one will receive his own reward according to his own labor."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we are God’s fellow workers; you are God’s field, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God’s building. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "According to the grace of God which was given to me, as a wise master builder I have laid the foundation, and another builds on it. But let each one take heed how he builds on it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For no other foundation can anyone lay than that which is laid, which is Jesus Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now if anyone builds on this foundation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gold, silver, precious stones, wood, hay, straw, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "each one’s work will become clear; for the Day will declare it, because it will be revealed by fire; and the fire will test each one’s work, of what sort it is. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone’s work which he has built on "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " endures, he will receive a reward. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone’s work is burned, he will suffer loss; but he himself will be saved, yet so as through fire."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that you are the temple of God and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Spirit of God dwells in you? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "destroys"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "defiles the temple of God, God will destroy him. For the temple of God is holy, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "temple"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you are."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Avoid Worldly Wisdom"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one deceive himself. If anyone among you seems to be wise in this age, let him become a fool that he may become wise. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the wisdom of this world is foolishness with God. For it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He catches the wise in their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "own"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "craftiness”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and again, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "knows the thoughts of the wise, that they are futile.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let no one boast in men. For all things are yours: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whether Paul or Apollos or Cephas, or the world or life or death, or things present or things to come—all are yours. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Christ’s, and Christ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God’s."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}